odyCues.field_gun_breech null (no recording; the gun's case clangs anyway). Land block updated 21 Nov 20:12Z by the ground sound thread: land.bodyCues.medic_tend null (the medic's cue, silent until a real take passes) and land.armourStrikes (rounds on a tank's armour; its list is empty, so nothing changes until round eight's steel hits pass). 21 Nov 20:50Z: air.closeView.masterDb 7.5 (was 3.1): the game's chase view measured 4.4 dB under the -12 LUFS the close view was set for (air.closeView._masterDb says how). Land block updated 21 Nov 20:54Z by the ground sound thread: five silent land.bodyCues for the GI's bazooka team and the loader's carbine (bazooka_fire, rocket_loaded, wire_contact, helmet_tap, rifle_shot), each with a note, so no clip cue asks for a missing take; no sound changes. 21 Nov 21:50Z: the master limiter's attack near instant (buses.master.limiterAttackMs 0.02, limiterLookAheadMs 1, limiterAnalogDetector false, limiterReleaseMs 500 (was 120)): with a 1 ms attack the Mac's runs still reached 0.00 dBFS (buses.master._detector says why). Land block updated 21 Nov 21:51Z by the ground sound thread (round eight, Brian's stamps of 21:41Z): crack_woods_01 joins land.cracks.single; ricochet_whine_01..03 join land.groundStrikes.whines; land.armourStrikes.smallArms = steel_hit_01..03; new land.landings (mortar_impact_01/02 middle, mortar_impact_far_01/02 far) and land.engines (Panzer IV and Tiger driving on panzer_engine_loop); incoming_shell and ricochet Cut, so land.incoming stays empty (land.incoming._round8). 21 Nov 22:05Z: round seven stamped by Brian (21:40Z): b17_interior_loop Good, so riding a B-17 plays it open at +2 dB in place of its drone through the filter (air.closeView.bed.interior, interiorGainDb); plane_hit and hmg_burst_long Cut (air.roundsHit stays silent). Land block updated 21 Nov 23:40Z by the ground sound thread: five silent land.bodyCues for the GI thread's new clips (radio_squelch, radio_talk; thompson_mag_out, thompson_mag_in, thompson_cock), each null with a note, so no clip cue asks for a missing take; no sound changes. 22 Nov 04:20Z: round nine stamped by Brian (03:40Z): real B-17s replace the studio library's. Riding a B-17 plays one of two recordings from inside one (air.closeView.bed.interior B-17, a list now, one per ridden bomber), and a B-17 formation's engines are three B-17s filmed flying over (air.loops B-17); levels unchanged (-20.0 LUFS). Land block updated 22 Nov 05:40Z by the ground sound thread: land.tankMg (a tank's machine guns by army, and the Sherman's roof .50 on gunner_burst), and land.mgClose.parts gains gunner_burst and maxim_burst (_parts says why); no take from outside the approved pack. 22 Nov (patch 0021, the Bremen r2d film): the close view's guns stand out of the ridden engine: air.closeView.masterDb 7.5 -> 9.5 and bed.gainDb 6 -> 1 (the notes say why); a gunner's twin mount is heard as one take (gunsByCalibre._wing); notes corrected where the code differs (masterDbByCameraDistance, closeView._notBuilt). Land block updated 22 Nov 12:46Z by the ground sound thread: land.mgClose.moreParts (maxim_burst's first two bursts, so a crowded Soviet section's burst plays from one of them instead of a copy already sounding; _moreParts says why); nothing else changes.",
